  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a large paella pan over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the sliced onions and cook until they are lightly caramelized.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the catfish chunks and cook until they are browned on all sides.",
    "Add the almond paste, fish sauce, lime juice, and chili flakes, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Stir in the chopped scallions and cook for an additional 1 minute.",
    "Remove the pan from the heat and let it cool slightly.",
    "Serve the ca kho to hot, garnished with additional scallions if desired."
